# ASLD - Arithmetic Shift Left D (opcode 0x05)

---
name: shifts left
memory: 05
setup: a=40 b=01
expect: a=80 b=02 N=1 V=1 C=0
cycles: 1

---
name: sets carry and zero
memory: 05
setup: a=80 b=00
expect: a=00 b=00 C=1 Z=1 V=1
cycles: 1

---
name: sets negative
memory: 05
setup: a=40 b=00
expect: a=80 b=00 N=1 V=1 C=0
cycles: 1
